{"id":"d59b0b327715a4b0","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-complete.md","title":"Theory Completeness","display":"df-complete — Theory Completeness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-complete","aliases":["67-df-complete"],"display":"df-complete — Theory Completeness","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_chapter":2,"source_label":"opening definition","source_printed_pages":23,"source_pdf_pages":34,"source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-complete — Theory Completeness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"source_label","html":"opening definition"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"34"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 是固定有效一阶语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 是公理集合；句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 使用固定完整一阶演算的可推导性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}_L\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}_L(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (T\\vdash\\varphi\\ \\lor\\ T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Complete}_L(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (T\\vdash\\varphi\\ \\lor\\ T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Chapter 2 开头定义 complete 为没有不可判定句子；没有要求公理集合本身演绎封闭。若另假设 Closed_L(T)，才可用成员关系替代可推导性。一致性另作前提；不一致理论也是完备的。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定有效一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 是公理集合；句子见 [[67-df-sentence]]，$T\\vdash\\varphi$ 使用固定完整一阶演算的可推导性，见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ 是固定有效一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 是公理集合；句子见 [[67-df-sentence]]，$T\\vdash\\varphi$ 使用固定完整一阶演算的可推导性，见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}_L(T)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (T\\vdash\\varphi\\ \\lor\\ T\\vdash\\neg\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1304,"backlinks":[{"id":"d3b04e0df1122f31","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0e0d50a09d6e5d48","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{REAx},\\mathrm{Complete}_L,\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]、[[67-df-complete]]、[[67-df-decidable]]。"},{"id":"7fdea8f95f2861a9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"589664f33390c7ce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0485e18b7419ccd1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-complete]]"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-complete]]"}],"outgoing":["854772391cef4007","573b4c635ea6d91f"]}